@chambleebrandel Subtle but HIGHLY appreciated and charming feature of DP World Tour coverage... no manipulated on-screen leaderboards. Just traditional first-in, higher-up ordering. As it should be.

PGA Tour coverage always puts the most popular players at the top, regardless of how far along in their rounds they are.
